{"src":"fr","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":175400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"fr","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5861.343219,"text":"Les lions sont les chats les plus sociables, vivant en grand groupe, populés meutes."},{"kind":"text","t":6170.716013,"text":"Lions are the most social cats, living in large groups known as prides."},{"kind":"audio","t":6217.1503809999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6220.360276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6222.88864,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6223.973985,"samples":29496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":11134.631838000001,"text":"Dans le climat chaud du Moyen-Orient, la maison n'était pas si importante."},{"kind":"text","t":11398.026957999999,"text":"In the hot climate of the Middle East, the house wasn’t that important."},{"kind":"audio","t":11439.340877999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11444.118569999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11449.487734999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":11450.668188,"samples":13296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":19410.253064,"text":"Presque tous les pirages sont sablonneux et permettent de se baigner en toute sécurité. La plupart sont ombragés par des pollues du coq à boire."},{"kind":"text","t":19691.150749,"text":"Almost all of these beaches are sandy and safe for swimming. Most of them are shaded by drinking cock thorns."},{"kind":"audio","t":19727.756274,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19733.214678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":19738.234476999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":19738.784628999998,"samples":10296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":19793.782647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19799.418247999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19803.487130999998,"samples":28664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":27087.982999,"text":"Les meutes sont composées d'un à trois mâles adultes, apparentés ainsi que d'une trentaine de femelles et de lionceaux."},{"kind":"text","t":27429.814888,"text":"The prides consist of one to three related adult males, along with about thirty females and cubs."},{"kind":"audio","t":27488.75264,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27493.869858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27498.851208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":27504.167042999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27509.497978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":27510.032541,"samples":9560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":34969.981865,"text":"Les enfants sauvages peuvent avoir suivi de graves abus ou traumatismes avant d'être abandonnés ou de s'enfuir."},{"kind":"text","t":35246.685018,"text":"Wild children may have suffered severe abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"audio","t":35295.426464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35300.728988999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35305.833918,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35311.323469999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":35317.004910999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":35317.343736,"samples":2960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":40721.26391,"text":"Le bus 403 de Scotterb se rend régulièrement à Sintra."},{"kind":"text","t":40973.085193,"text":"Scotterb Bus 403 runs regularly to Sintra."},{"kind":"audio","t":41015.361029,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41016.823788,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41018.319007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41018.924678999996,"samples":18096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":43702.613353,"text":"avec un arrêt à cabot d'Aroca."},{"kind":"text","t":43916.121423,"text":"with a stop at Cabot d’Aroca."},{"kind":"audio","t":43947.612471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43952.009389,"samples":32032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":52007.303191,"text":"Pour admirer les plus beaux panoramas de Hong Kong, quittez l'île et rejoignez le front de mer de Kowloon situé en face."},{"kind":"text","t":52419.445122,"text":"To enjoy the most beautiful views of Hong Kong, leave the island and head to the waterfront in Kowloon across from it."},{"kind":"audio","t":52467.611395,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52473.088338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52478.224896,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52483.66499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52488.911656,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52493.759498,"samples":31760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":59948.707923,"text":"Les opinions d'Aristote sur toutes les questions scientifiques, y compris la psychologie, ont été acceptées."},{"kind":"text","t":60226.127906,"text":"Aristotle’s views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were accepted."},{"kind":"audio","t":60263.491661,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60268.453051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60273.726437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60278.840725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":60281.121483,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":67238.494027,"text":"L'Australien Mitchell Gourlay est arrivé 11e au Super G Debout Homme."},{"kind":"text","t":67534.42010999999,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gourlay finished 11th in the Men’s Standing Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":67567.790681,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67573.206595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67578.465022,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67581.828874,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":72739.052354,"text":"Le tchèque Aldrich Jelinek s'est classé 16e au Super JAC Home."},{"kind":"text","t":73050.788945,"text":"The Czech Aldrich Jelinek finished 16th in the Super JAC Home."},{"kind":"audio","t":73110.395218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73111.587071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73113.121569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73113.830099,"samples":21096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":82272.988106,"text":"La ville contraste fortement avec les cités du reste du pays car elle possède un style davantage arabe qu'africain."},{"kind":"text","t":82698.981692,"text":"The city stands in sharp contrast to cities elsewhere in the country, as it has a more Arab-style architecture rather than an African one."},{"kind":"audio","t":82751.564063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82757.04919599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82762.413881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82767.653537,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82773.118751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82778.284698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82782.870664,"samples":31392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":92021.77389,"text":"Aussi, après la Révolution, les métiers furent ouverts à tous les candidats masculins, permettant aux plus ambitieux et aux plus talentueux de réussir."},{"kind":"text","t":92390.427561,"text":"Also, after the Revolution, professions were open to all male candidates, allowing the most ambitious and talented to succeed."},{"kind":"audio","t":92432.109916,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92433.470567,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92434.829128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92436.422355,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":92438.23011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92439.65005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":92440.857893,"samples":31392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":100815.127544,"text":"La bombe à fission fonctionne selon le principe suivant. Elle transforme l'énergie en assemblant un noyau d'une myriade de protons et de neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":101176.114984,"text":"A fission bomb operates based on the following principle. It transforms energy by assembling a nucleus from a myriad of protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":101211.299399,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":101216.715113,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101221.838881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":101222.121587,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":101283.089611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101288.092291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101293.488085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101299.014437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101301.884937,"samples":22528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":107355.021232,"text":"Il n'a pas chiffré ses réductions, disant qu'elles seront basées sur la production économique chinoise."},{"kind":"text","t":107695.240373,"text":"He did not specify the amounts of the cuts, saying they would be based on China’s economic output."},{"kind":"audio","t":107764.894445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107770.802002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":107775.798391,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107781.279234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107786.293394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"audio","t":107786.649799,"samples":1160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":115759.655886,"text":"Il n'existe pas de définition universelle permettant de déterminer si un objet manufacturé est une antiquité."},{"kind":"text","t":116025.984615,"text":"There is no universal definition to determine whether a manufactured object is an antique."},{"kind":"audio","t":116074.893918,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116079.992167,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":116085.193154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116090.765225,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":116096.384007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":116096.752691,"samples":6560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":122039.78464299999,"text":"Certains organismes fiscaux définissent les biens de plus de 100 ans comme des antiquités."},{"kind":"text","t":122312.635231,"text":"Some tax authorities define items over 100 years old as antiques."},{"kind":"audio","t":122349.368575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122354.44850299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":122359.734699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122365.38513,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":122365.592057,"samples":6328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":128234.565898,"text":"Vous n'avez pas forcément besoin d'un yacht dans les archipels et sur les lacs."},{"kind":"text","t":128489.139052,"text":"You don’t necessarily need a yacht in the archipelagos and lakes."},{"kind":"audio","t":128523.180474,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128528.42297099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128533.769025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":128534.48959499999,"samples":10896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":136890.82835800003,"text":"On dit donc que le rapport d'aspect de ce format en divisant par 12 pour obtenir le plus simple des rapports de nombre entier est de 3 sur 2."},{"kind":"text","t":137375.159665,"text":"It is said that the aspect ratio of this format, when divided by 12 to obtain the simplest integer ratio, is 3 to 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":137429.77211800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":137435.573757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137441.04771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137446.42580400003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137451.774149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137456.920507,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137461.29461500002,"samples":30792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":143789.73791300002,"text":"Sa réputation en tant qu'épicentre du luxe a débuté aux environs de l'an 400 et a duré jusqu'à 1100 environ."},{"kind":"text","t":144188.127087,"text":"Its reputation as a center of luxury began around the year 400 and lasted until about 1100."},{"kind":"audio","t":144237.58056300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144238.98937300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144240.27175500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144241.85060300003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":144243.37981100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144245.005158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":144245.34908400002,"samples":12192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":156976.417457,"text":"Les politiques d'annulation varient, mais à partir de fin mars, la plupart des politiques d'annulation basées sur le coronavirus ne s'étendent pas jusqu'en juillet 2020, date à laquelle les Jeux Olympiques avaient été prévus."},{"kind":"text","t":157549.11212300003,"text":"Cancellation policies vary, but starting from late March, most coronavirus-related cancellation policies did not extend until July 2020, the date when the Olympics were scheduled to take place."},{"kind":"audio","t":157625.12892500003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157630.097515,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157635.33144100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":157640.85374400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157646.209749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157651.695172,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157656.953848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157660.303431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":157663.49687600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157666.79406000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157669.462902,"samples":29920,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":164575.26199,"text":"Mélangez les deux poudres sèches ensemble puis avec les mains propres et humides, pressez-les en une boule."},{"kind":"text","t":164912.34801500003,"text":"Mix the two dry powders together, then use clean, moist hands to press them into a ball."},{"kind":"audio","t":164950.70720600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164955.725986,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164961.11116,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164966.36804600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164969.378174,"samples":22528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"input","t":174237.57463900003,"text":"Les croisières à Saint-Pétersbourg incluent du temps passé dans la ville. Les passagers des croisières sont exemptés de l'obligation de visa, voire les conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":174575.42591400002,"text":"Cruises to St. Petersburg include time spent in the city. Cruise ship passengers are exempt from visa requirements, as well as related conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":174622.454853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174627.61430100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174633.39435000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":174634.169869,"samples":10896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":174663.30061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174668.76665300003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174673.79044200003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":174678.99295900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174683.262889,"samples":29728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"close","t":185504.929913,"code":1005}]}